---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy - KharchaTracker" showNav={false}>
  <a href="/" class="text-sm mb-4 inline-block no-underline" style="color: #6366f1;">&larr; Back to Home</a>

  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text);">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Last updated: October 2026</p>

  <div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text);">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Introduction</h2>
      <p>KharchaTracker ("we", "our", "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle your information when you use our expense tracking web application.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Data Storage</h2>
      <p><strong>All your financial data is stored locally on your device.</strong> We do not collect, store, or transmit your personal financial information to any server.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">What We Don't Collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li>No personal financial data (expenses, income, budgets)</li>
        <li>No personally identifiable information</li>
        <li>No bank or payment details</li>
        <li>No location data</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> We display advertisements. Google may use cookies for ad personalization. Opt out at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" style="color: #6366f1;" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ad Settings</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> We may collect anonymous usage statistics to improve the app.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Data Export & Deletion</h2>
      <p>Export all data as JSON from Settings. Clear all data anytime from Settings. Clearing browser data removes all app data.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Questions? Email: <a href="mailto:hello@kharchatracker.com" style="color: #6366f1;">hello@kharchatracker.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
